[[Norman]] has been waiting for you in the final room. Realizing that you have already earned four other Badges, he accepts that you are capable enough to battle him. He is happy to finally have a real battle with his child, but promises to hold nothing back! He leads with the first of his two {{p|Slaking}}, a species with high physical {{stat|Attack}}. This advantage is mitigated somewhat by its Ability, {{a|Truant}}; the Pokémon would rather loaf around, and only acts every other turn. In the meantime, attack with your strongest [[Special move|special]] attacks to overwhelm its impressive {{stat|HP}} rating. His {{p|Vigoroth}} is much more energetic, and its {{a|Vital Spirit}} Ability prevents {{status|sleep}}. His second Slaking can restore its health with {{m|Slack Off}}; use your strongest attacks to knock it out quickly, before it can use {{m|Focus Punch}}! Avoid using status-inflicting moves; each of Norman's Pokémon knows {{m|Facade}}, which doubles in power when the user is {{status|Poison|poisoned}}, {{status|Paralysis|paralyzed}}, or {{status|Burn|burned}}.

